    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAD CTRL is a chill VR multiplayer game featuring realistic RC car physics in fun environments.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics recreates the challenge and fun of driving RC cars around any environment. Hangout with your friends, or meet new ones, with the best light-competitive VR multiplayer racer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Features in Early Access:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic RC Car Physics</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Dialed-in handling that captures the twitchy, responsive feel of real RC racers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Unique Tracks</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Tear through tight corners and catch air across a variety of track types, with more in the works.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unique RC Cars</strong> \u2013 From nimble buggies to high-speed racers, every car has its own style and performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo or with Friends</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Race alone or compete online with up to 10 players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Hop into Race mode or stunt your cars in Freestyle mode\u2014more modes are planned as development continues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Everything</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Tweak your RC car setup, design your own liveries, and fine-tune your transmitter for a personal touch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar Creator</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Design your in-game self and show up at the track with style.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAD CTRL is a chill VR multiplayer game featuring realistic RC car physics in fun environments.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics recreates the challenge and fun of driving RC cars around any environment. Hangout with your friends, or meet new ones, with the best light-competitive VR multiplayer racer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Features in Early Access:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic RC Car Physics</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Dialed-in handling that captures the twitchy, responsive feel of real RC racers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Unique Tracks</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Tear through tight corners and catch air across a variety of track types, with more in the works.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unique RC Cars</strong> \u2013 From nimble buggies to high-speed racers, every car has its own style and performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo or with Friends</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Race alone or compete online with up to 10 players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Hop into Race mode or stunt your cars in Freestyle mode\u2014more modes are planned as development continues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Everything</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Tweak your RC car setup, design your own liveries, and fine-tune your transmitter for a personal touch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar Creator</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Design your in-game self and show up at the track with style.</p></li></ul>",
